      <activity id="f0abb7bf-d444-5dda-9a95-165dab6853a6" activityNameId="dd691ae9-7008-59b7-8f2a-128e0f3b19c9" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="2" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Polyethylene, LDPE, granulate, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Polyethylene, LDPE, granulate, at plant
A methane emissions update has been incorporated into the LCI of datasets downloaded from the PlasticsEurope website. UUID=c4dbbb99-22d0-37c1-8cc7-fc5a8c64329b
All processes are considererd including waste treatment of process waste
Location: EU27 including Norway and Switzerland
Technology: The polymer process, upstream processes like ethylene production, electricity, and steam production as well as transportation of feedstock and waste treatment.
Time period: time to which data mainly refer: 2011 with the methane emission updates in 2023
Production volume: referring to covered LDPE production (72.3% of 6,392 kt in 2011)
Sampling: Questionnaires sent out to all production units in Europe operated by PlasticEurope member companies.
Extrapolations: no extrapolation
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c4dbbb99-22d0-37c1-8cc7-fc5a8c64329b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
